---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
const url = (path) => `${base}${path}`;
---
<BaseLayout title='Miles Physio — Get back to more of what you love' description='Specialist care for knee, hip and lower-back pain. Discover personalised Apos treatment and online physiotherapy with Chris Miles, Clinical Director.' bodyClass='' styles={[]} apos={false}>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><div class="hero-top"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="mini-line"></span> Specialist care. Personal progress.</p><p class="hero-location">Knee, hip & lower-back pain</p></div><div class="hero-grid"><div><h1 id="hero-title">Get back to more<br>of what you <em>love.</em></h1></div><div class="hero-intro"><p>When pain gets in the way, understanding your options is a good place to start. At Miles Physio, we combine expertise in how you move with care built around you.</p><a class="button" href="https://miles-physio.uk1.cliniko.com/bookings#service">Book your free discovery call <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a><span class="micro">A conversation. A clearer next step. 10 minutes.</span></div></div><div class="hero-visual apos-hero-feature"><div class="hero-feature-copy"><p class="hero-feature-kicker">Apos® treatment at Miles Physio</p><div><p class="hero-feature-heading">Move better.<br>Feel better.</p><p class="hero-feature-description">Specialist footwear, individually adjusted to help reduce pain and improve walking.</p><a href={url('/aposhealth/')} class="hero-feature-link">Discover Apos <svg class="arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></a></div></div><div class="hero-product-panel"><div class="hero-product-title"><strong>Apos® footwear</strong></div><div class="hero-product-montage"><div class="hero-product-image"><img src={url('/assets/apos-shoe.jpg')} alt="Apos footwear with two adjustable pods beneath the sole" width="2560" height="1707" fetchpriority="high"></div><div class="hero-movement-image"><img src={url('/assets/movement-full.jpg')} alt="A woman moving in Apos footwear" width="1707" height="2560"><span>Movement in everyday life</span></div></div><div class="hero-product-details"><div><span>01 / The device</span><strong>Two adjustable pods</strong></div><div><span>02 / Your treatment</span><strong>Tailored to how you walk</strong></div></div></div></div><div class="hero-foot"><span>A longer walk. An easier climb upstairs.</span><span>The confidence to make plans again.</span></div></section>

<section id="approach" class="section approach"><div class="section-label reveal"><span>01 / Built around you</span><span>Our approach</span></div><div class="intro-grid"><h2 class="reveal">What would you like<br>to feel able to<br><span class="blue">do again?</span></h2><div class="copy reveal"><p class="large-copy">Perhaps walking has become uncomfortable. You’re thinking twice about exercise. Or you’ve started working your day around your pain.</p><p>We start by listening: to what’s changed, what you’ve already tried, and what you want to get back to. Together, we’ll work towards a clearer understanding of your symptoms and a practical plan for moving forward.</p></div></div><div class="approach-bottom reveal"><h3>Understanding your movement.<br>Caring for the whole person.</h3><div class="copy"><p>Your symptoms are one part of the picture. How you walk, your daily routine and your personal goals all help shape your care.</p><p>We bring together clinical assessment, movement expertise and personalised rehabilitation to help you understand your options. You’ll have space to ask questions and take an active part in decisions about your treatment.</p></div></div></section>
<section id="apos" class="apos-section"><div class="section"><div class="section-label reveal"><span>02 / Apos treatment</span><img src={url('/assets/apos-logo.png')} alt="Apos" width="1324" height="447" loading="lazy"></div><div class="apos-grid"><div class="apos-copy reveal"><h2>A different approach<br>starts with<br><span class="blue">how you walk.</span></h2><p>Apos® uses specially designed footwear, individually adjusted by a trained clinician, to change how forces act through your joints as you walk.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('/aposhealth/')}>Explore Apos treatment <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a></div><div class="product-stage reveal"><span class="product-label">Personalised to your every step</span><img class="product-image" src={url('/assets/apos-shoe.jpg')} alt="Apos footwear with adjustable pods beneath the sole" width="2560" height="1707" loading="lazy"><span class="product-detail">Apos® <span>Individually adjusted. Clinically guided.</span></span></div></div><div class="treatment-notes reveal"><div><span class="step-number">01</span><h3>A clearer picture</h3><p>Your programme begins with an assessment of your symptoms and walking pattern.</p></div><div><span class="step-number">02</span><h3>A fit for you</h3><p>If Apos is suitable for you, we’ll tailor the devices to your needs and guide you through using them in your daily routine.</p></div><div><span class="step-number">03</span><h3>Progress, together</h3><p>Follow-up appointments help us review your progress and make adjustments along the way.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section id="chris" class="section chris-section"><div class="portrait-wrap reveal"><img src={url('/assets/chris.jpg')} alt="Chris Miles, Clinical Director at Miles Physio" width="998" height="1500" loading="lazy"><div class="portrait-caption"><strong>Chris Miles</strong><span>Clinical Director</span></div></div><div class="chris-copy reveal"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="mini-line"></span> Meet your clinician</p><h2>Expertise in movement.<br><span class="blue">A personal approach<br>to care.</span></h2><p class="large-copy">Meet Chris Miles, Clinical Director at Miles Physio.</p><p>Chris brings together a background in sports science, physiotherapy and a master’s in biomechanics—the study of how the body moves. His experience spans NHS and private practice, with a particular interest in osteoarthritis and persistent joint pain.</p><p>At the heart of his approach is a simple aim: helping you understand your condition and feel better equipped to manage it.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('/about/')}>More about Chris <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a></div></section>
<section id="stories" class="stories-section"><div class="section"><div class="section-label reveal"><span>03 / Patient stories</span><span>Everyday life, rediscovered</span></div><div class="stories-heading reveal"><h2>What getting back to<br><span class="blue">everyday life can mean.</span></h2><div class="story-controls"><button class="circle-button" id="story-prev" aria-label="Previous testimonial"><svg class="arrow-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 12H4M11 5l-7 7 7 7"/></svg></button><span id="story-count" aria-live="polite">01 / 04</span><button class="circle-button" id="story-next" aria-label="Next testimonial"><svg class="arrow-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></button></div></div><p class="stories-intro reveal">Hear from people who have shared their experience of treatment with Miles Physio.</p><div class="stories-track" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Patient testimonials. Use the arrow buttons or swipe to explore.">
<article class="story-card"><span class="quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span><blockquote>This is one of those examples of things that you have to try to believe. Both my father and I have used these. I had a huge knee trauma at 16. My knee was getting worse and worse. I'd had 5 operations on it. The surgeon said I had 10 years left with the knee when I was 38. Dad saw Apostherapy and we went. It took time but things got better and better. After 7 months I was playing squash again. After 12 months I went skiing. I had done either of those things since my 20's. It is wierd looking but it works. It's genius.</blockquote><div class="patient"><span class="patient-initials" aria-hidden="true">MB</span><div><strong>Matt Bradney</strong><span>Atrium Fitness Owner</span></div></div></article>
<article class="story-card"><span class="quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span><blockquote>Having played a lot of hockey for many years I was in a lot of pain with both my knees. Couple this with an occupation that involved a large amount of kneeling and my knees were very swollen and painful. Having worn the boots for over a year now, I feel completely different. I have much less pain and no swelling. I have even just started Couch to 5k.</blockquote><div class="patient"><span class="patient-initials" aria-hidden="true">SF</span><div><strong>Sue Field</strong><span>Retired Teacher</span></div></div></article>
<article class="story-card"><span class="quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span><blockquote>This note could not be big enough for the thanks I have for my AposTherapy boots and the people I have seen, in the last 3 years, checking my pain levels, stiffness, adjusting my boots and advice on how to help me live a pain-free knee and hip life. Now I do, I am back walking, aqua classes and enjoying everyday things that make life worthwhile again, Thank you, thank you, thank you, love Patricia Young xx</blockquote><div class="patient"><span class="patient-initials" aria-hidden="true">PY</span><div><strong>Patricia Young</strong><span>Essex patient</span></div></div></article>
<article class="story-card"><span class="quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span><blockquote>Treatment really does help relieve my knee joint problem. I am coming to the end of my 3 year programme and am still more mobile now than when the treatment commenced.</blockquote><div class="patient"><span class="patient-initials" aria-hidden="true">KC</span><div><strong>Keith Cambridge</strong><span>Essex patient</span></div></div></article>
</div><div class="story-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div></div></section>
<section id="online" class="section online-section"><div class="online-kicker"><span class="screen-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none"><rect x="9" y="12" width="46" height="32" rx="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M23 54h18M32 44v10M22 28l7 6 13-13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg></span><p class="eyebrow">Online physiotherapy</p></div><div class="online-content"><h2 class="reveal">Personalised support,<br><span class="blue">wherever you join us from.</span></h2><div class="online-description reveal"><p class="large-copy">Get physiotherapy advice and guidance through a video appointment.</p><div class="copy"><p>We’ll discuss your symptoms, assess your movement and develop a plan that may include exercises, self-management techniques and changes to everyday activities. Follow-up appointments give us time to review how you’re getting on and adapt your plan.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('/online-physiotherapy/')}>Explore online physiotherapy <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a></div></div></div></section>
<section id="start" class="start-section"><div class="section"><div class="section-label reveal"><span>04 / Getting started</span><span>One step at a time</span></div><div class="start-grid"><div class="reveal"><h2>Your next step<br>can be a<br><span class="blue">conversation.</span></h2><a class="button" href="https://miles-physio.uk1.cliniko.com/bookings#service">Book your free discovery call <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a></div><div class="journey reveal"><details open><summary><span>01</span>Tell us what’s happening<i aria-hidden="true">+</i></summary><p>Book a free discovery call to discuss your concerns and find out how we may be able to help.</p></details><details><summary><span>02</span>Understand your options<i aria-hidden="true">+</i></summary><p>An assessment helps us explore your symptoms, movement and goals, and discuss a suitable treatment approach.</p></details><details><summary><span>03</span>Put your plan into practice<i aria-hidden="true">+</i></summary><p>Get clear guidance on what to do next, with follow-up support to review your progress.</p></details></div></div></div></section>
<section id="contact" class="contact-section"><div class="contact-inner reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Here when you’re ready</p><h2>Let’s talk about<br>what’s holding<br><span>you back.</span></h2><div class="contact-copy"><p>You don’t need to know which treatment to choose before getting in touch. Start with a conversation about your symptoms, your concerns and what you’d like help with.</p><a class="button white-button" href="https://miles-physio.uk1.cliniko.com/bookings#service">Book your free discovery call <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a><p class="contact-direct">Prefer to contact us directly?<br><a href="tel:+447980700940">07980 700 940</a><br><a href="mailto:info@milesphysio.com">info@milesphysio.com</a></p></div></div><div class="contact-ring" aria-hidden="true"></div></section>


</main>
</BaseLayout>
